{"unit_id":"ManoloRemiddi__dsh-steering#card-zh","repo":"ManoloRemiddi/dsh-steering","commit":"b7d2e18dbf612d647cfb032dcb1b5cde874b1827","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-steering 是面向 DSH Web profile 的插件：让用户在模型尚未完成输出时提交纠正，并尽快开始处理。它通过 DSH 生命周期钩子观察助手生成、工具执行和收件箱变化；生成期间收到的用户消息会取消当前请求，同时保留其他排队工作，并把原消息提前交给下一轮。主要能力包括保留纠正消息 ID、让普通排队消息继续等待、在工具执行期间等到安全边界，以及清理会话和插件状态。适合希望及时修正长回答、又不想丢失后续提示的 DSH 使用者。需要 DSH 0.1.5-rc.1；代码没有额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:2-5","steering.mjs:19-42"]}
{"unit_id":"ManoloRemiddi__dsh-steering#card-en","repo":"ManoloRemiddi/dsh-steering","commit":"b7d2e18dbf612d647cfb032dcb1b5cde874b1827","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-steering applies corrections during DSH web generation. It cancels the active request, preserves queued prompts, and puts the original correction first in the next turn. Ordinary prompts wait; corrections wait while tools run. Requires DSH 0.1.5-rc.1, with no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:2-5","steering.mjs:19-42"]}
